      "question": "The 8D report describes a bore-diameter escape on valve body AP-3312. Which machine does it name, and how many unplanned maintenance events, hours of unplanned downtime and dollars of quality defect cost has that machine logged since 1 July 2026?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-03T04:17:19.401872Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-03T04:17:29.904947Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "The 8D report (8D-2026-014) names **MTY-LTH-04** (a CNC lathe at the Monterrey Plant, Cell D) as the source of the bore-diameter escape on valve body AP-3312 [1].\n\nSince 1 July 2026, that machine has logged:\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Unplanned maintenance events | 1 |\n| Unplanned downtime hours | 52.0 |\n| Unplanned maintenance cost (parts & labor) | $3,471.09 |\n| Quality defect cost | $18,358.40 |\n\n[2]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Unstructured Retrieval evidence — 8d_report_valve_body_bore_oversize.pdf — evidence `hermes-receipt:2b0e96a54db965010edea5c06f78ddbdbf48e8104a2ec70ec2efc584f8520ef9`\n- [2] Structured retrieval result — manufacturing_operations — evidence `hermes-receipt:5a130e8e749fb23bf53376e0846ec385cda17c437e33eb0ea76c75cc4f21fc7e`",
        "citations": [
