                "snippet": "8D Report: Bore Diameter Oversize on Valve Body AP-3312\nD2. Problem description\nWhat, Answer = Main bore of valve body AP-3312 (proportional valve body PV-12) oversize; bore specification 22.000 mm, +0.021 / 0 mm.. Where, Answer = Monterrey Plant, CNC lathe MTY-LTH-04 (Cell D). Found at in-process gauging and by the customer.. When, Answer = Customer return detected 14 August 2026; in-plant records from 3 August to 21 August 2026.. Who, Answer = Monterrey operators and quality inspectors; Brightline Hydraulics incoming inspection.. How many, Answer = 48 pieces returned by the customer; 285 pieces in 12 in-plant records.. How detected, Answer = Customer incoming inspection; in-process air gauge on one piece in 25.. Cost, Answer = $12,844.80 of scrap and rework, including the customer return.\nTable 1. Problem statement (5W2H).\nThe in-plan nonconformances were all recorded as defect type dimension_oob against part AP-3312 on lathe MTY-LTH-04, under work orders WO-00725 and WO-00784. Of the 285 pieces affected, 96 were scrapped and 189 were reworked.",
                "metadata": {
                  "parser": "nemotron-parse-2.0",
